{"id":"H8007","lemma":"שַׂלְמָא","transliteration":"salma","sayIt":"sal-MA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Salmon","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Rut.4.20;\nson of: Nahshon (H5177);\nhusband of: Rahab (H7343);\nfather of: Boaz (H1162); also called Sala at Luk.3.32;\n§ Salma = \"garment\"\n1) father of Boaz, father-in-law of Ruth, and grandfather of David\n1a) also 'Salmon', 'Salmah'","glosses":["salma","salmon"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Salmon","kjv":"Salma"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"Salma","kjv":"Salma"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":54,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Salma","kjv":"of Salma"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:11","note":"and Nahshon became the father of Salma, and Salma became the father of Boaz,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0221","lemma":"אוּרִי","transliteration":"uri","gloss":"Uri"},{"id":"H1162","lemma":"בֹּ֫עַז","transliteration":"boaz","gloss":"Boaz"},{"id":"H2354","lemma":"חוּר","transliteration":"chur","gloss":"Hur"},{"id":"H2780","lemma":"חָרֵף","transliteration":"chareph","gloss":"Hareph"},{"id":"H3031","lemma":"יִדְבָּשׁ","transliteration":"yidbash","gloss":"Idbash"},{"id":"H3157","lemma":"יִזְרְעֶאל","transliteration":"yizreel","gloss":"Jezreel"},{"id":"H3457","lemma":"יִשְׁמָא","transliteration":"yishma","gloss":"Ishma"},{"id":"H5177","lemma":"נַחְשׁוֹן","transliteration":"nachshon","gloss":"Nahshon"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8007H","gloss":"Salma","relation":"H8007H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}